{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"roleHeading":"Protocol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Component.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Component.swift#L48"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Component"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","symbolKind":"protocol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Component","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Component"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"inheritsFrom","title":"Inherits From"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformingTypes","title":"Conforming Types"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Component"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6BundleP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle","text":"Bundle"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryTermP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldMo